<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Mitac forecasts jump in profits.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Mitac forecasts jump in profits.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitac International Corp, one of Taiwan's leading computer makers, projected its 1997 pre-tax profit at T$300.652 million, up 121 percent from T$135.479 million last year, a company statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Mitac forecast its 1997 sales at T$17.504 billion, up from 1996's $12.497 billion, the statement said.</p>
<p>Its 1997 earnings per share were forecast at T$0.60, up from T$0.38 in 1996.</p>
<p>($1 = T$27.6)</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
